<title>USA: CSX Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>CSX Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.17		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			253,000		  276,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,703,000		2,710,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 216,829		  210,461</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.00		    $2.94</p>
<p> Net			855,000		  618,000</p>
<p> Revs		  10,536,000	     10,304,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 213,633		  210,270</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year includes a $257 million, or $0.76 a share, pretax restructuring charge.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 includes a net investment gain of $77 million pre-tax, or $0.24 a share, from issuance of stake in Sea-Land terminal and related operations in Asia.</p>
<p>Company issued about five million shares of stock to officers and key employees on August 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Periods ended Dec. 27 vs Dec. 29.</p>
</text>
